-- ==============================================================================
-- Tytul:        rep1.prm
-- Opis:         Parametry Parallel Replicat rep1 (blok 9 raportu, tryb nonintegrated): logowanie
--               aliasem, MAP_PARALLELISM 2, mapowanie HR i SALES 1:1.
-- Description [EN]: Parameters of the Parallel Replicat rep1 (report block 9, nonintegrated mode):
--               login by alias, MAP_PARALLELISM 2, HR and SALES mapped 1:1.
-- Autor: KCB Kris | Data: 2026-11-14 | Wersja: 1.0 | Konwencje: <repo>/SETTINGS.md
-- Uzycie / Usage: 88_oggconf_target.sh kopiuje do <deployment>/etc/conf/ogg/rep1.prm
-- ==============================================================================
REPLICAT rep1
USERIDALIAS ggtarget DOMAIN OracleGoldenGate
-- LAB: MAA gives a range of 2-5
MAP_PARALLELISM 2
MAP HR.*, TARGET HR.*;
MAP SALES.*, TARGET SALES.*;
